DAIR08   DS    CL84                    Allocation parm block            00062700
DAIR18   DS    CL40                    Unallocation parm block          00062800
*                                                                       00062900
MSG3     DS    CL(L'MSG3X)                                              00063000
MSG6     DS    CL(L'MSG6X)                                              00063100
SW       DS    X                       Flags                            00063200
$913     EQU   128                     913 abend occurred               00063300
$PWUPD   EQU   64                      Password updated                 00063400
$DFTUPD  EQU   32                      Default group updated            00063500
$OSCHG   EQU   16                      OPERATIONS and/or SPECIAL updt   00063600
*                                                                       00063700
SPECIAL  DS    C                       Y or N for SPECIAL               00063800
OPER     DS    C                       Y or N for OPERATIONS            00063900
WORKPASS DS    CL9                     1 byte length + password         00064000
WORKL    EQU   *-WORKAREA              Length of working storage        00064100
